# Every text file under windows/ is checked out with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says. GitHub's Windows runners
# check out with autocrlf=true, which turned the C# into CRLF and broke the multi-line anchors in
# scripts/guard-selftest.ps1. The Mac's scene files are not here: sync-assets reads them as git blobs.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.xml -text
